  /* the meaning in the app's language and the Translate-all row (v256) */
  "The app's own texts and the meaning of new cards. Cards keep their Chinese and pinyin.":"Teks aplikasinya sendiri dan arti kartu baru. Kartu tetap punya bahasa Mandarin dan pinyinnya.","Meanings":"Arti","{0} have their meaning in another language.":"{0} punya arti dalam bahasa lain.","Translate all cards into {0}":"Terjemahkan ke {0}","Translating {0} of {1} …":"Menerjemahkan {0} dari {1} …","{0} translated, {1} left.":"{0} kartu diterjemahkan, {1} lagi.","Done — {0} translated.":"Selesai — {0} diterjemahkan.",
